Meta.documentation:DawnCompiler
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Compiles Dawn source into runnable JavaScript.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The compilers entry point: tokenizes canonical Dawn source (URIs, lists,
Meta.documentation:flows) and generates the JavaScript that dawn_run.js and the web console
Meta.documentation:execute. Flavor grammars (dawn/Flavors/*.bnft) translate surface syntax — e.g.
Meta.documentation:the basic flavor — into canonical Dawn before this compiler sees it.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status internal
Meta.documentation:

